---
description: SEO metadata, JSON-LD, sitemap, crawlable cinema
globs: src/app/**/*.{ts,tsx,mdx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# SEO

- Every route: `buildMetadata()` from `lib/seo`
- Articles: `type: "article"` + `publishedTime` + tags
- RSS `/feed.xml`; OG `/api/og`
- JSON-LD: WebSite, fan Organization, Article, FAQ, Person, Breadcrumb, ItemList
- `sitemap.ts` + `robots.ts` (disallow `/api/`)
- Primary story copy must be crawlable HTML — not canvas-only
- Visible unofficial disclaimer in chrome / legal
- LCP poster `priority`; never video/WebGL as LCP
